    5 │ const min3 = array.toSorted((a, b) => a - b satisfies number)[0];
  
  i Sorting does much more work than finding the smallest value, which only needs to look at each item once.
  
  i Use Math.min() with the array spread into its arguments instead.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  
  i Unsafe fix: Use Math.min() instead.
  
